  "description": "Update the section-header parsing rule in CooklangParser.swift (and/or Parser.swift) so that a line matching = <name> (exactly one leading =, a space, then the section name to end of line) opens a new section whose name is the captured text trimmed. The old == Name == syntax is dropped \u2014 lines starting with == become plain step text. All other section rules from spec 0001 are unchanged: implicit unnamed leading section for steps before the first = header, step numbering restarts at 1 in each named section, blank lines tolerated.",
